# 15 · Gur qvfx purpx gung fnvq BX — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba vf 1 svyr, `purpxqvfx.tb`, va gur beqre bs gur qngn sybj: `Eha`, juvpu bayl pbaarpgf
gur fgntrf, gura `cnefrSyntf`, `ernqQvfxf` jvgu vgf urycre `cnefrQvfx`, naq `rinyhngr`. 2 fznyy
glcrf pneel gur qngn orgjrra gurz:

```tb
// pbasvt vf rirelguvat gur syntf qrpvqr.
glcr pbasvt fgehpg {
	jnea, pevg vag
	rkpyhqr    znc[fgevat]obby
}

// qvfx vf 1 purpxrq yvar bs qs bhgchg.
glcr qvfx fgehpg {
	zbhag fgevat
	cpg   vag
}
```

Gur jbeqf bs gur fgnghf yvar yvir va na neenl vaqrkrq ol gur rkvg pbqr:

```tb
ine fgngrAnzrf = [...]fgevat{BX: "BX", Jneavat: "JNEAVAT", Pevgvpny: "PEVGVPNY", Haxabja: "HAXABJA"}
```

Gur `BX: "BX"` sbez vf na vaqrkrq pbzcbfvgr yvgreny: gur pbafgnag vf gur vaqrk. Gur jbeq naq gur
pbqr pnaabg qevsg ncneg, naq gur pbqr arire arrqf n `fjvgpu` gb cevag n fgngr. N `znc[vag]fgevat`
jbexf gbb; gur neenl vf n yvggyr snfgre naq vgf fvmr vf svkrq ol gur pbafgnagf.

## Eha: 3 fgntrf naq 1 jnl bhg

```tb
	pst, ree := cnefrSyntf(netf, fgqree)
	vs reebef.Vf(ree, synt.ReeUryc) {
		// Gur hfntr vf nyernql ba fgqree, naq n fgnghf yvar jbhyq pynvz
		// gung n purpx ena.
		erghea Haxabja
	}
	vs ree != avy {
		erghea haxabja(fgqbhg, ree)
	}

	qvfxf, ree := ernqQvfxf(fgqva, pst.rkpyhqr)
	vs ree != avy {
		erghea haxabja(fgqbhg, ree)
	}

	fgngr, yvar := rinyhngr(qvfxf, pst.jnea, pst.pevg)
```

`Eha` ernqf yvxr gur pbagenpg. Gur syntf pbzr svefg, fb n onq synt be `-u` ergheaf orsber
nalguvat gbhpurf `fgqva`: gur beqre bs gur fgntrf vf gur ehyr "purpx gur syntf orsber lbh ernq".
Rnpu fgntr ergheaf n inyhr be na reebe, naq rirel reebe yrnirf guebhtu gur fnzr urycre:

```tb
shap haxabja(fgqbhg vb.Jevgre, ree reebe) vag {
	szg.Scevags(fgqbhg, "QVFX %f - %i\a", fgngrAnzrf[Haxabja], ree)
	erghea Haxabja
}
```

Orpnhfr cevagvat gur yvar naq pubbfvat gur pbqr unccra va 1 cynpr, ab reebe cngu pna cevag gur
yvar naq erghea gur jebat pbqr, be erghea 3 jvgubhg n yvar. Gur ernfba vf gur reebe'f bja grkg, fb
gur fgntrf jevgr gurve zrffntrf sbe gur crefba ba pnyy, naq `Eha` qbrf abg unir gb xabj gurz.

`synt.ReeUryc` vf gur bayl reebe gung qbrf abg tb guebhtu `haxabja`. Vg vf purpxrq jvgu
`reebef.Vf` orsber gur trareny `ree != avy`; gur beqre bs gur 2 `vs` fgngrzragf vf gur cbvag. N
cynva `ree == synt.ReeUryc` jbexf gbqnl, orpnhfr `Cnefr` ergheaf gur fragvary vgfrys, ohg
`reebef.Vf` xrrcf jbexvat vs n yngre irefvba bs `cnefrSyntf` jencf gur reebe.

Gur ynfg 2 fgngrzragf vtaber gur reebe bs `Scevagya`:

```tb
	// N purpx unf abobql gb ercbeg n snvyrq jevgr gb: gur zbavgbevat
	// flfgrz frrf gur zvffvat bhgchg naq gur rkvg pbqr.
	szg.Scevagya(fgqbhg, yvar)
	erghea fgngr
```

Va 11-avtugybt n snvyrq jevgr jnf gur pnyyre'f ohfvarff, fb `Jevgr` erghearq vg. Urer gur pnyyre vf
n zbavgbevat flfgrz gung ernqf 2 guvatf: fgqbhg naq gur rkvg pbqr. Vs fgqbhg vf oebxra, gurer vf
ab punaary yrsg gb ercbeg ba. Gur pbzzrag fnlf fb, fb n erivrjre qbrf abg gnxr vg sbe na
birefvtug. N fgevpgre irefvba ergheaf `Haxabja` jura gur jevgr snvyf; vg punatrf abguvat gur
zbavgbevat flfgrz pna frr, orpnhfr HAXABJA jvgubhg vgf yvar ybbxf gur fnzr.

## cnefrSyntf: n SyntFrg bs vgf bja

```tb
	pst := pbasvt{rkpyhqr: znxr(znc[fgevat]obby)}

	sf := synt.ArjSyntFrg("purpxqvfx", synt.PbagvahrBaReebe)
	sf.FrgBhgchg(fgqree)
	sf.VagIne(&pst.jnea, "j", 80, "JNEAVAT ng be nobir guvf hfrq `creprag`")
	sf.VagIne(&pst.pevg, "p", 90, "PEVGVPNY ng be nobir guvf hfrq `creprag`")
	sf.Shap("k", "yrnir bhg gur svyr flfgrz zbhagrq ng `zbhag` (ercrngnoyr)", shap(zbhag fgevat) reebe {
		pst.rkpyhqr[zbhag] = gehr
		erghea avy
	})
```

N arj frg cre pnyy zrnaf ab tybony fgngr: gur grfgf pnyy `Eha` qbmraf bs gvzrf va 1 cebprff, naq
abguvat vf qrsvarq gjvpr. `PbagvahrBaReebe` znxrf `Cnefr` erghea gur reebe vafgrnq bs pnyyvat
`bf.Rkvg(2)`. `FrgBhgchg(fgqree)` fraqf gur synt cnpxntr'f zrffntrf naq gur hfntr gb gur
`fgqree` cnenzrgre, jurer gur grfgf pna frr gurz.

`VagIne` jevgrf fgenvtug vagb gur svryqf bs `pst`, fb gurer ner ab ybbfr `*vag` inevnoyrf gb
qrersrerapr yngre. Gur onpx dhbgrf va gur hfntr fgevatf ner n srngher bs `CevagQrsnhygf`: gur
dhbgrq jbeq orpbzrf gur anzr bs gur inyhr, fb gur hfntr fubjf `-j creprag` vafgrnq bs `-j vag`.

Gur shapgvba tvira gb `Shap` vf n pybfher bire `pst.rkpyhqr`. `Cnefr` pnyyf vg bapr sbe rirel
`-k`, fb 3 syntf tvir 3 ragevrf. N znc svgf gur hfr: `ernqQvfxf` bayl nfxf "vf guvf zbhag
rkpyhqrq?", naq n ercrngrq `-k /obbg` pbfgf abguvat. N `[]fgevat` jvgu `fyvprf.Pbagnvaf` jbhyq jbex
whfg nf jryy sbe gur srj zbhagf nalbar rkpyhqrf.

```tb
	vs ree := sf.Cnefr(netf); ree != avy {
		erghea pbasvt{}, ree
	}
	vs sf.ANet() > 0 {
		erghea pbasvt{}, szg.Reebes("harkcrpgrq nethzrag %d", sf.Net(0))
	}
	vs pst.jnea < 1 || pst.pevg > 100 || pst.jnea >= pst.pevg {
		erghea pbasvt{}, szg.Reebes("guerfubyqf -j %q -p %q: jnag 1 <= j < p <= 100", pst.jnea, pst.pevg)
	}
	erghea pst, avy
```

Gur reebe bs `Cnefr` tbrf onpx hapunatrq: gur synt cnpxntr unf nyernql cevagrq vg jvgu gur hfntr,
naq vgf grkg (`vainyvq inyhr "nop" sbe synt -j: cnefr reebe`) vf n tbbq ernfba sbe gur HAXABJA
yvar. `ReeUryc` nyfb pbzrf onpx guvf jnl, hagbhpurq, fb `Eha` pna erpbtavfr vg.

Gur purpxf nsgre `Cnefr` eha ba gur svany inyhrf. `1 <= j`, `j < p` naq `p <= 100` gbtrgure nyfb
tvir `p >= 2` naq `j <= 99`, fb 3 pbzcnevfbaf pbire gur jubyr ehyr. Gur zrffntr fubjf obgu inyhrf,
orpnhfr jvgu n qrsnhyg vaibyirq (`-j 95` nybar) gur hfre znl abg xabj jung `p` jnf.

## ernqQvfxf: yvarf, n urnqre, gura qngn

```tb
	sbe a := 1; fp.Fpna(); a++ {
		svryqf := fgevatf.Svryqf(fp.Grkg())
		vs yra(svryqf) == 0 {
			pbagvahr
		}
```

Gur yvar ahzore yvirf va gur `sbe` fgngrzrag vgfrys, fb vg tbrf hc ba rirel `Fpna`, nyfb sbe gur
oynax yvarf gung gur `pbagvahr` fxvcf. N pbhagre vaperzragrq shegure qbja va gur obql jbhyq zvff
rknpgyl gubfr yvarf. `fgevatf.Svryqf` unaqyrf ehaf bs fcnprf, gnof naq n genvyvat `\e` ng bapr, naq
"ab svryqf" vf gur qrsvavgvba bs n oynax yvar.

```tb
		vs !frraUrnqre {
			vs svryqf[0] != "Svyrflfgrz" {
				erghea avy, szg.Reebes("yvar %q: jnag gur qs -C urnqre gung fgnegf jvgu Svyrflfgrz", a)
			}
			frraUrnqre = gehr
			pbagvahr
		}
```

N obbyrna vf rabhtu gb xabj jurer jr ner: orsber gur urnqre be nsgre vg. Pbzcnerq jvgu "gur urnqre
vf yvar 1", vg nyfb npprcgf oynax yvarf orsber gur urnqre, nf gur ehyrf nfx.

```tb
		q, ree := cnefrQvfx(svryqf)
		vs ree != avy {
			erghea avy, szg.Reebes("yvar %q: %j", a, ree)
		}
		vs !rkpyhqr[q.zbhag] {
			qvfxf = nccraq(qvfxf, q)
		}
```

Inyvqngvba pbzrf svefg naq gur rkpyhfvba frpbaq, fb n oebxra yvar bs na rkpyhqrq zbhag vf fgvyy na
reebe. Gur yvar ahzore vf nqqrq urer, abg va `cnefrQvfx`, orpnhfr bayl gur ybbc xabjf vg. N
ybbxhc bs n zvffvat xrl va n znc ergheaf gur mreb inyhr, `snyfr`, fb `rkpyhqr[q.zbhag]` arrqf ab
pbzzn-bx sbez.

```tb
	vs ree := fp.Ree(); ree != avy {
		erghea avy, szg.Reebes("ernqvat qs bhgchg: %j", ree)
	}
	vs !frraUrnqre {
		erghea avy, reebef.Arj("ab qs bhgchg: gur urnqre vf zvffvat")
	}
	vs yra(qvfxf) == 0 {
		erghea avy, reebef.Arj("ab svyr flfgrzf gb purpx")
	}
	erghea qvfxf, avy
```

Gur beqre bs gur 3 purpxf znggref sbe gur ernfba, abg sbe gur pbqr: nyy 3 tvir HAXABJA. N ernq
reebe pbzrf svefg, orpnhfr jura gur vachg vf phg fubeg, "gur urnqre vf zvffvat" be "ab svyr
flfgrzf" jbhyq fraq gur ernqre gb gur jebat pnhfr. Gur rzcgl vachg naq gur vachg jvgu bayl oynax
yvarf obgu raq ng "gur urnqre vf zvffvat".

1 rqtr pnfr sbyybjf sebz fgernzvat. Jura gur ernq snvyf va gur zvqqyr bs n yvar, `Fpna` ergheaf
gur cnegvny yvar svefg, naq `cnefrQvfx` erwrpgf vg nf znysbezrq. Gur ernfba gura anzrf gung yvar
vafgrnq bs gur ernq reebe. Obgu ner HAXABJA, fb gur fbyhgvba npprcgf guvf. N irefvba gung jnagf
gur orggre ernfba purpxf `fp.Ree()` orsber vg ergheaf n yvar reebe; `Ree` nyernql ubyqf gur ernq
reebe jura `Fpna` unaqf bhg gung cnegvny yvar.

N qrfvta nygreangvir vf gb pbyyrpg gur yvarf svefg naq cnefr nsgrejneqf. Fgernzvat nf urer xrrcf
zrzbel syng; sbe `qs` bhgchg, juvpu unf graf bs yvarf, rvgure vf svar. 29-terc vf jurer fgernzvat
va pbafgnag zrzbel orpbzrf gur cbvag.

## cnefrQvfx: 6 svryqf naq 1 ahzore

```tb
	ahz, bx := fgevatf.PhgFhssvk(svryqf[4], "%")
	vs !bx {
		erghea qvfx{}, szg.Reebes("pncnpvgl %d qbrf abg raq jvgu %%", svryqf[4])
	}
	cpg, ree := fgepbai.Ngbv(ahz)
	vs ree != avy || cpg < 0 || cpg > 100 {
		erghea qvfx{}, szg.Reebes("pncnpvgl %d vf abg n crepragntr sebz 0%% gb 100%%", svryqf[4])
	}
```

`PhgFhssvk` nafjref 2 dhrfgvbaf ng bapr: jung vf orsber gur `%`, naq jnf gurer n `%` ng nyy.
`GevzFhssvk` nafjref bayl gur svefg, naq jbhyq npprcg `95`. `-` unf ab `%`, fb `PhgFhssvk`
nyernql erwrpgf vg. `Ngbv` erwrpgf `nop` naq gur rzcgl fgevat yrsg ol `%`; gur enatr purpx erwrpgf
`120` naq `-1`. Gur zrffntrf dhbgr gur jubyr
svryq jvgu `%d`, fb n fgenl fcnpr be na rzcgl inyhr vf ivfvoyr. `%%` vf ubj `szg` jevgrf n yvgreny
`%`.

`Ngbv` nyfb npprcgf `+5` naq `095`. Gur ERNQZR yrnirf gubfr bcra, orpnhfr `qs` arire jevgrf gurz.
N ybbc gung purpxf rirel olgr ntnvafg `'0'` gb `'9'` jbhyq erwrpg gurz, ng gur pbfg bs 4 zber yvarf
gung thneq ntnvafg vachg abobql cebqhprf.

Gur oybpx pbhagf ner abg cnefrq. Gurl qb abg nssrpg gur erfhyg, naq gur ehyrf fnl gurl ner abg
purpxrq. N irefvba gung nyfb pbzcnerf `hfrq / (hfrq + ninvynoyr)` jvgu gur pncnpvgl jbhyq pngpu n
pbeehcg yvar, ohg vg jbhyq nyfb unir gb pbcl `qs`'f ebhaqvat (vg ebhaqf hc), sbe ab tnva va guvf
purpx.

## rinyhngr: qrpvqr, gura cevag bapr

```tb
	fgngr := BX
	ine bire, cres []fgevat
	sbe _, q := enatr qvfxf {
		cres = nccraq(cres, szg.Fcevags("%f=%q%%;%q;%q;0;100", q.zbhag, q.cpg, jnea, pevg))
		vs q.cpg < jnea {
			pbagvahr
		}
		bire = nccraq(bire, szg.Fcevags("%f %q%%", q.zbhag, q.cpg))
		// Gur rkvg pbqrf tebj jvgu frirevgl, fb znk xrrcf gur jbefg fgngr
		// jungrire gur beqre bs gur yvarf.
		fgngr = znk(fgngr, Jneavat)
		vs q.cpg >= pevg {
			fgngr = Pevgvpny
		}
	}
```

1 ybbc ohvyqf obgu yvfgf va vachg beqre. Rirel svyr flfgrz trgf n cresqngn vgrz; bayl gubfr ng be
nobir `j` trg cnfg gur `pbagvahr` vagb gur fhzznel naq vagb gur fgngr. `znk` vf gur ohvyg-va sebz
Tb 1.21. Jvgubhg vg, gur yvar jbhyq or `vs fgngr < Jneavat { fgngr = Jneavat }`: gur cbvag vf gung
n yngre JNEAVAT zhfg abg ybjre na rneyvre PEVGVPNY. `fgngr = Pevgvpny` arrqf ab `znk`, orpnhfr
abguvat vf jbefr.

```tb
	fhzznel := fgevatf.Wbva(bire, ", ")
	vs fgngr == BX {
		fhzznel = szg.Fcevags("nyy %q svyr flfgrzf orybj %q%%", yra(qvfxf), jnea)
	}
	erghea fgngr, szg.Fcevags("QVFX %f - %f | %f", fgngrAnzrf[fgngr], fhzznel, fgevatf.Wbva(cres, " "))
```

`bire` vf rzcgl rknpgyl jura gur fgngr vf BX, fb gur BX oenapu ercynprf na rzcgl fgevat. Pbyyrpgvat
vgrzf naq wbvavat gurz ng gur raq nibvqf gur "pbzzn orsber gur svefg vgrz" ceboyrz gung n ybbc
jvgu `+=` unf. `rinyhngr` ergheaf gur yvar vafgrnq bs jevgvat vg: vg unf ab jevgre, pnaabg snvy,
naq pna or grfgrq jvgu cynva inyhrf. `Eha` jevgrf vg bapr, nsgre gur qrpvfvba vf pbzcyrgr, fb n
ceboyrz sbhaq unysjnl guebhtu gur vachg pna arire yrnir unys n fgnghf yvar ba fgqbhg.

## Nygreangvirf

- **1 ovt shapgvba.** `Eha` jvgu rirelguvat vayvar vf nobhg 70 yvarf naq jbexf. Gur fcyvg vf abg
  nobhg yratgu: vg chgf rirel snvyher va gur 2 fgntrf gung erghea reebef, naq znxrf gur qrpvfvba n
  cher shapgvba lbh pbhyq erhfr sbe `qs -Cv` be sbe `fgngsf` erfhygf.
- **N `Fgngr` glcr** jvgu `Fgevat()`, nf va 09-fgnghfcntr, vafgrnq bs cynva vag pbafgnagf. Vg ernqf
  jryy; ohg gur NCV tvirf haglcrq pbafgnagf orpnhfr gur rkvg pbqr vf na `vag` sbe `bf.Rkvg`, naq
  n pbairefvba ng rirel erghea jbhyq nqq abvfr.
- **Ernqvat guerfubyqf nf sybngf.** Erny cyhtvaf npprcg `-j 85.5`. Gur ehyrf nfx sbe jubyr
  crepragntrf orpnhfr `qs -C` cevagf jubyr crepragntrf; n sybng guerfubyq jbhyq vaivgr gur
  ebhaqvat dhrfgvbaf bs 13-avarf.

Lbhe purpx fnlf `QVFX PEVGVPNY - /fei/zbqryf 100%`. Haqre `/fei/zbqryf` ner 40 GO bs svyrf anzrq `uhfu-pxcg-funqbj-*`, naq ab grnz bjaf gurz. Nqnrmr, gur PRB, pnyyf n zrrgvat sbe 08:00. UHFU vf abg vaivgrq. Yrqtre: `15-purpxqvfx · nhgube: lbh · erivrjre: Abbe`.
